<title>FRANCE: Axa-UAP to buy out Courtage, IARD units.</title>
<headline>Axa-UAP to buy out Courtage, IARD units.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axa-UAP proposed on Tuesday to buy out minority shareholders of two units, offering 1,400 francs per share for Axa Courtage Vie and 1,050 per share for Axa Assurances IARD, French bourse regulator Conseil des marches financiers said.</p>
<p>Axa-UAP holds 99 percent of Axa Assurances IARD and 99.59 percent of Courtage Vie, the conseil said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
